143 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 305 0 R
/E (Top Performer: The STACK1 Ensemble is the "Champion" model, achieving a peak accuracy of 0.892 on IMDB, representing a 3.5% improvement over the baseline.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
144 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 306 0 R
/E (Architectural Efficiency: While Transformers and RNNs were tested, Optimized SVMs and Ensemble Stacking consistently yielded the highest scores across IMDB and Amazon datasets.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
145 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 307 0 R
